  "details": "I have 3 avatars now with this issue. Basically if you make your avatar talk with ONLY a jawflap blendshape, and dont include anything else, like not even the blinking blendshapes, then the jawflap will not work locally.\n\nOn occasion it will work I've found, if I've been in a world for a very long time and have swapped avatars a few times and go back to the broken one. it may start working for me locally.\n\nEveryone else sees the jawflap fine at all times so its only a local bug.",
